Poufnik name dictionary artifact
================================

`engine/src/anonymizer_engine/detection/resources/names.db` is generated by
`engine/tools/build_name_db.py` from the following open datasets:

- dane.gov.pl dataset 1667, "Lista imion występujących w rejestrze PESEL",
  license: CC0 1.0, latest resources used at build time: state as of
  2026-01-20.
- dane.gov.pl dataset 1681, "Nazwiska występujące w rejestrze PESEL",
  license: CC0 1.0, latest national resources used at build time: state as of
  2026-01-20.
- SJP.PL Polish spell-checking dictionary, used only to derive the homograph
  list, is distributed with several license options including Apache License
  2.0. Poufnik uses it under Apache License 2.0.

The build step downloads source CSV/ZIP files. Runtime detection never contacts
these sources and uses only the committed SQLite artifact.

Third-party libraries under file-level copyleft
===============================================

- pikepdf (https://github.com/pikepdf/pikepdf), used unmodified by the engine for
  in-place PDF anonymization, is licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0.
  Its source code is available at the address above and on PyPI. It bundles qpdf
  (https://github.com/qpdf/qpdf), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
